    <Element Type="Comment" Id="49D22A1C">
        <Comment>
            Fear should be last or close to it. This is due to how its implemented. 
            It blocks further actions while it gives random directions for the Feared unit to run, so if that unit dies it returns back here and any later actions will be pointing at an invalid unit.
        </Comment>
